# React Stopwatch Patterns

- Keep timing logic deterministic and isolated.
- Use `useEffect` intervals with proper cleanup.
- Prefer derived display state from raw elapsed time.
- Keep UI components focused; move shared logic to helpers/hooks.

# State Guidance

- Keep global state minimal in `App`.
- Use typed models for metrics/logs.
- Avoid tightly coupling view routing with timer internals.

# UX Guidance

- Preserve tactical visual consistency.
- Keep fallback behavior for missing assets.
- Respect reduced-motion users for animation effects.
